    {
      "id": "dev-partial-pricing-page:seg:0",
      "text": "Pricing page. The new prices take effect on the 13th, so the page has to match by then."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-partial-pricing-page:seg:1",
      "text": "The 13th is a Friday, right?"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-partial-pricing-page:seg:2",
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-partial-pricing-page:seg:3",
      "text": "Sales already sent the existing customers their notice, so that side is covered."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-partial-pricing-page:seg:4",
      "text": "OK. What changes on the page?"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-partial-pricing-page:seg:5",
      "text": "The pricing update. Starter goes from twelve to fifteen, Team from twenty-nine to thirty-two."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-partial-pricing-page:seg:6",
      "text": "And enterprise stays as contact us?"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-partial-pricing-page:seg:7",
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-partial-pricing-page:seg:8",
      "text": "Customers keep asking about annual billing, so the timing is good."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-partial-pricing-page:seg:9",
      "text": "Agreed. I'll build the pricing update on a branch and send you a preview link on Monday."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-partial-pricing-page:seg:10",
      "text": "Great. So the pricing update is live on the 13th, Jun owns it."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-partial-pricing-page:seg:11",
      "text": "Yep, live on the 13th."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-partial-pricing-page:seg:12",
      "text": "Perfect. I'll update the sales deck to match."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-partial-pricing-page:seg:13",
      "text": "Do we need to change the FAQ?"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-partial-pricing-page:seg:14",
      "text": "The FAQ still says prices are locked for a year. That's no longer true for monthly plans."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-partial-pricing-page:seg:15",
      "text": "Then I'll rewrite that answer."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-partial-pricing-page:seg:16",
      "text": "Send me the new copy and I'll swap it in."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-partial-pricing-page:seg:17",
      "text": "Will do. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-partial-pricing-page:seg:18",
      "text": "Only that the sales team will want to link straight to the page from proposals."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-partial-pricing-page:seg:19",
      "text": "The URL won't change, so old links keep working."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-partial-pricing-page:seg:20",
      "text": "Good. That's it, then."
    }
  ],
